<title>BULGARIA: BULGARIA C.BANK REFINANCING UP AT 56.59 BLN LVS.</title>
<headline>BULGARIA C.BANK REFINANCING UP AT 56.59 BLN LVS.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgarian National Bank's (BNB)</p>
<p>refinancing to commercial banks rose to 56.586 billion levs on</p>
<p>September 20 from 54.369 billion levs on August 30, BNB</p>
<p>preliminary figures showed.</p>
<p> BNB refinancing, mln levs	SEPT 20    AUG 30   JULY 26</p>
<p> Uncollatelarized deposits	 51,173    51,173    51,469</p>
<p> Lombard loans			  4,959     2,687     9,319</p>
<p> Discount loans			   397	 402	 407</p>
<p> Overdraft				  107	 107	 255</p>
<p> Total loans and deposits	  56,586    54,369    61,450</p>
<p> BNB treasury portfolio	    93,413    85,345    71,269</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 981 8569</p>
</text>
